### Step-by-Step Installation

1. Save all files using the provided structure into an empty directory.
2. Ensure you have an icon at `icons/googless-48.png`.
3. In Firefox, open `about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox`.
4. Click **Load Temporary Add-on…** and select `manifest.json`.
5. Navigate to any test URL:
   - `https://forsale.godaddy.com/...` (Catches `googlesyndication.com` dynamic network hits via `webRequest`).
   - `https://levelimposter.net/` (Catches `firestore.googleapis.com`).
   - `https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moe_anthropomorphism` (Styles proprietary outbound links directly on the page in **red/yellow**).
   - `https://startpage.com/` (Default-whitelisted; functions unimpeded)."
